 <p class="large" style="font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary); line-height: 1.6;">
 My name is Anna Hellmuth. I'm a medical doctor, psychologist, and life coach.
 </p>
 <p class="large" style="font-weight: var(--font-weight-body); margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
